+
+    <div class="card" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px;">
+        <h3 style="color: #4ade80; margin-top: 0;">🛠️ 2. How-To Guides</h3>
+        <p>Practical, task-oriented instructions for specific goals:</p>
+        <ul>
+            <li><a href="docs/how-to/install-windows-herd.md">Windows Setup with Laravel Herd</a></li>
+            <li><a href="docs/how-to/install-linux-native.md">Native Linux Installation (Ubuntu, Debian, AlmaLinux)</a></li>
+            <li><a href="docs/how-to/run-podman-docker-containers.md">Podman & Docker Container Deployment</a></li>
+            <li><a href="docs/how-to/deploy-cloud-render-github-pages.md">Cloud Deployment & GitHub Pages</a></li>
+            <li><a href="docs/how-to/create-manage-pages.md">Creating Pages with Pair Logic</a></li>
+            <li><a href="docs/how-to/customize-themes-navigation.md">Theming & Navigation Customization</a></li>
+            <li><a href="docs/how-to/manage-content-flatfiles.md">Flat-File Content Management</a></li>
