+            <li><a href="docs/how-to/configure-seo-sitemaps.md">SEO, Sitemaps & Structured Data</a></li>
+            <li><a href="docs/how-to/run-tests-static-analysis.md">Testing & Quality Assurance</a></li>
+        </ul>
+    </div>
+
+    <div class="card" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px;">
+        <h3 style="color: #fbbf24; margin-top: 0;">📋 3. Reference</h3>
+        <p>Factual specifications and API references:</p>
+        <ul>
+            <li><a href="docs/reference/system-requirements.md">System Requirements (PHP 8.4)</a></li>
+            <li><a href="docs/reference/cms-context-api.md">CmsContext Class Reference</a></li>
