+--- DSOM Token Efficiency Audit ---
+Scenario A (Bloated Context): 2465 tokens
+Scenario B (DSOM Optimized Context): 93 tokens
+Token Reduction: 96.23%
+Absolute Savings: 2372 tokens per turn
+```
